          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_leuven_presented_icml_2023_revisits",
          "text": "This paper, from KU Leuven and presented at ICML 2023, revisits Kernel Principal Component Analysis through the lens of convex duality.",
          "expected_role": "figure",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "leuven",
            "presented",
