        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s07_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_looser_tolerance_ten_to_the_minus_tw",
          "text": "At the looser tolerance of ten-to-the-minus-two, it is faster than full SVD, Lanczos, and randomized SVD on every task, and it is at least three times faster than randomized SVD, peaking at a nine-point-one-seven times speedup on CIFAR-10 with its sixty thousand images, where full SVD could not even finish within thirty minutes.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
