        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s07_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_just_importantly_method_robust_prope",
          "text": "Just as importantly, the method is robust to a property that hurts randomized SVD badly: as the eigenspectrum of the Gram matrix decays more slowly, randomized SVD needs many more oversamples, while the proposed solver's iteration count barely changes.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
